Compendium of all background music in the [[Games#Spin-offs|spin-off games]] and [[The Battle Cats|main]] [[Nyanko Daisensou|games]] that [[PONOS Corporation|PONOS]] has made that plays while you are in any part of the game.

Most non-collab music tracks were produced by [https://www.north-sound.net/user_data/works.php North Sound], and the official Japanese names of all tracks up to "Big Bang Kumikyoku" were revealed in the [https://www.amazon.co.jp/にゃんこ大戦争-音楽大全集-オリジナル・サウンドトラック/dp/B077M8YXS6 Battle Cats CD]; the rest do not have confirmed official names. Certain tracks were given English names in the [[Anniversary/10th Year|10th Anniversary]] event, as the names of stages in Pt. 5: Musical Parade.

